<article id="post-2967" class="post-2967 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-quarterly category-listed-issuers">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-9-now-live/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="339" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/CSE-Quarterly-2016-issue-2-Cover-672x339.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="The CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 9 is Now Live!" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/CSE-Quarterly-2016-issue-2-Cover-672x339.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/CSE-Quarterly-2016-issue-2-Cover-300x151.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="3018" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-9-now-live/cse-quarterly-2016-issue-2-cover/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/CSE-Quarterly-2016-issue-2-Cover.jpg" data-orig-size="675,339" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="CSE-Quarterly-2016-issue-2-Cover" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/CSE-Quarterly-2016-issue-2-Cover.jpg" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-quarterly/" rel="category tag">CSE Quarterly</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/listed-issuers/" rel="category tag">Listed Issuers</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-9-now-live/" rel="bookmark">The CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 9 is Now Live!</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-9-now-live/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2016-06-01T07:30:37-04:00">June 1, 2016</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<h2><a href="https://issuu.com/uptickpublishing/docs/cse_quarterly_issue_2_2016" target="_blank"><img decoding="async" data-attachment-id="2690" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/pic_blog_20160306_cse_quarterly_pdac2016/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/Pic_Blog_20160306_CSE_Quarterly_PDAC2016.png" data-orig-size="176,227" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Pic_Blog_20160306_CSE_Quarterly_PDAC2016" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/Pic_Blog_20160306_CSE_Quarterly_PDAC2016.png" class="alignright wp-image-2690 size-full" src="https://cseblog.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Pic_Blog_20160531_CSE_Quarterly_Issue2_2016.png" alt="CSE Quarterly Issue 9" width="176" height="227" border="1" /></a>The CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 9 is Now Live</h2>
<p>The CSE is proud to present the latest edition of the CSE Quarterly.</p>
<p>This edition of the CSE Quarterly contains a special feature on four &#8216;difference makers&#8217; listed on the CSE.</p>
<p>Specifically, this issue explores the stories behind these popular CSE-listed companies and the entrepreneurs who are helping them grow.</p>
<p>The companies profiled in this issue include:</p>
<p>RESAAS Services Inc. (<a href="http://thecse.com/en/listings/technology/resaas-services-inc" target="_blank">CSE:RSS</a>)<br />
Lite Access Technologies Inc. (<a href="http://thecse.com/en/listings/technology/lite-access-technologies-inc" target="_blank">CSE:LTE</a>)<br />
PUDO Inc. (<a href="http://thecse.com/en/listings/diversified-industries/pudo-inc" target="_blank">CSE:PDO</a>)<br />
VirtualArmor International Inc. (CSE:VAI)<br />
Urbana Corporation (<a href="http://thecse.com/en/listings/diversified-industries/urbana-corporation" target="_blank">CSE:URB</a>)<br />
Laguna Blends Inc. (CSE:LAG)<br />
Captiva Verde Industries Ltd. (<a href="http://thecse.com/en/listings/diversified-industries/captiva-verde-industries-ltd" target="_blank">CSE:VEG</a>)<br />
Supreme Pharmaceuticals Inc. (<a href="http://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/supreme-pharmaceuticals-inc" target="_blank">CSE:SL</a>)<br />
Beleave Inc. (<a href="http://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/beleave-inc" target="_blank">CSE:BE</a>)</p>
<p>In addition, be sure to read the latest message from the Canadian Securities Exchange CEO, Richard Carleton, for updates on the Exchange for Entrepreneurs.</p>
<p>Missed a previous edition of the CSE Quarterly? <a href="https://cseblog.wpengine.com/cse-quarterly-innovation-work/" target="_blank">Click here</a> to access previous issues.</p>
<p>To have The CSE Quarterly delivered directly to your inbox, sign-up below:</p>
