<article id="post-2596" class="post-2596 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-tv">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-presents-lite-access-technologies/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="339" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/Pic_Blog_CSE_Presents_LiteAccessTechnology_web-672x339.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="The CSE Presents: Lite Access Technologies" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/Pic_Blog_CSE_Presents_LiteAccessTechnology_web-672x339.png 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/Pic_Blog_CSE_Presents_LiteAccessTechnology_web-300x151.png 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="2599" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-presents-lite-access-technologies/pic_blog_cse_presents_liteaccesstechnology_web/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/Pic_Blog_CSE_Presents_LiteAccessTechnology_web.png" data-orig-size="675,339" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Pic_Blog_CSE_Presents_LiteAccessTechnology_web" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/Pic_Blog_CSE_Presents_LiteAccessTechnology_web.png" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-tv/" rel="category tag">CSE TV</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-presents-lite-access-technologies/" rel="bookmark">The CSE Presents: Lite Access Technologies</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-presents-lite-access-technologies/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2016-02-19T14:07:46-05:00">February 19, 2016</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/sparxpg/" rel="author">Hamish Khamisa</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<p>The latest CSE-listed company to be featured in <strong>The</strong> <strong>CSE Presents</strong> series: Lite Access Technologies Inc. (CSE:LTE) will be visible online at BTV and in rotation on BNN during February 2016. Here is the ad you may have already seen on BNN:</p>
<p><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script src="https://video.b-tv.com/players/89GB5yJm-oN97cVjN.js" type="text/javascript"></script></p>
<p>In this longer segment, CEO Michael Priest, describes Lite Access Technologies&#8217;  offering in the fibre optic cable deployment space.  Click the video below to view.</p>
<p><iframe loading="lazy" src="https://video.b-tv.com/players/TIPzCGJn-oN97cVjN.html" width="480" height="270" frameborder="0" scrolling="auto"></iframe></p>
<p>Lite Access Technologies was also the featured company in <strong>The CSE Quarterly</strong> back in September. Access the issue below:</p>
<div class="issuuembed" style="width: 474px; height: 307px;" data-configid="0/30374488"></div>
<p><script src="//e.issuu.com/embed.js" async="true" type="text/javascript"></script></p>
<p>(Trouble accessing the publication below? <a title="The CSE Quarterly - Issue 3" href=" http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu?e=0/30374488" target="_blank">CLICK HERE TO ACCESS THE ISSUE</a>)</p>
<div class="sharedaddy sd-sharing-enabled"><div class="robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing"><h3 class="sd-title">Share this:</h3><div class="sd-content"><ul><li class="share-email"><a rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" data-shared="sharing-email-2596" class="share-email sd-button share-icon" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="sharing-email-2596" data-email-share-error-title="Do you have email set up?" data-email-share-error-text="If you&#039;re having problems sharing via email, you might not have email set up for your browser. You may need to create a new email yourself." data-email-share-nonce="d32233e4df" data-email-share-track-url="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-presents-lite-access-technologies/?share=email">
				<span id="sharing-email-2596" hidden>Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)</span>
				<span>Email</span>
			</a></li><li class="share-print"><a rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"
				data-shared="sharing-print-2596"
				class="share-print sd-button share-icon"
				href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-presents-lite-access-technologies/?share=print"
				target="_blank"
				aria-labelledby="sharing-print-2596"
				>
				<span id="sharing-print-2596" hidden>Print (Opens in new window)</span>
				<span>Print</span>
			</a></li><li class="share-twitter"><a rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"
				data-shared="sharing-twitter-2596"
				class="share-twitter sd-button share-icon"
				href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-presents-lite-access-technologies/?share=twitter"
				target="_blank"
				aria-labelledby="sharing-twitter-2596"
