	<img width="672" height="336" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER_feature_image-672x336.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="The CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 6 is Now Live" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER_feature_image.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER_feature_image-300x150.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="2675" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-6-now-live/cse_q3_cover_feature_image/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER_feature_image.jpg" data-orig-size="672,336" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="CSE_Q3_COVER_feature_image" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER_feature_image.jpg" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-performance/" rel="category tag">CSE Performance</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-quarterly/" rel="category tag">CSE Quarterly</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-6-now-live/" rel="bookmark">The CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 6 is Now Live</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-6-now-live/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2015-09-24T12:00:46-04:00">September 24, 2015</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<h2><a href=" http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu?e=0/30374488" rel="attachment wp-att-2669"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="2669" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-6-now-live/cse_q3_cover/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER.png" data-orig-size="174,227" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="CSE_Q3_COVER" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER.png" class="alignright wp-image-2669 size-full" style="border: 1px solid #000000;" src="https://cseblog.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/CSE_Q3_COVER.png" alt="CSE_Q3_COVER" width="174" height="227" /></a>The CSE Quarterly Profiles Notable Listed Companies</h2>
<p>The CSE is proud to present the sixth edition of its quarterly publication &#8211; the CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 3 &#8211; 2015 is now live! This issue profiles companies operating in a variety of industries including broadband technology, microwave energy, oil spill clean-up, and more. The companies profiled in this issue are:</p>
<p>Lite Access Technologies Inc. (<a href="https://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu/6" target="_blank">CSE:LTE</a>)<br />
Canadian Metals Inc. (<a href="https://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu/10" target="_blank">CSE:CME</a>)<br />
Targeted Microwave Solutions Inc. (<a href="https://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu/12" target="_blank">CSE:TMS</a>)<br />
Robix Alternative Fuel Solutions Inc. (<a href="https://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu/16" target="_blank">CSE:RZX</a>)<br />
IGEN Networks Corp. (<a href="https://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu/20" target="_blank">CSE:IGN</a>)<br />
BioNeutra Global Corporation (<a href="https://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/cse_q3_2015_issuu/24" target="_blank">CSE:BGA</a>)</p>
<p>To have The CSE Quarterly delivered directly to your inbox, sign-up below:</p>
