	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-quarterly/" rel="category tag">CSE Quarterly</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/listed-issuers/" rel="category tag">Listed Issuers</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-5-now-live/" rel="bookmark">The CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 5 is Now Live!</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-5-now-live/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2015-05-29T06:00:27-04:00">May 29, 2015</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<h2><a href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/1" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="2108" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-5-now-live/q2_2015_cover_mc/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/Q2_2015_cover_mc.jpg" data-orig-size="176,228" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Q2_2015_cover_mc" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/Q2_2015_cover_mc.jpg" class="alignright wp-image-2108 size-full" src="https://cseblog.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/Q2_2015_cover_mc.jpg" alt="The CSE Quarterly Issue 5" width="176" height="228" border="1" /></a>The CSE&#8217;s Magazine for Feature Companies</h2>
<p>The CSE is proud to present the fifth edition of its quarterly publication &#8211; the CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 2 &#8211; 2015 is now live! This issue profiles companies operating in a variety of industries including health technology, sensors, big data, and food retail. The companies profiled in this issue include:</p>
<p>Deer Horn Capital Inc. (<a href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/6" target="_blank">CSE:DHC</a>)<br />
Eight Solutions Inc. (<a href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/10" target="_blank">CSE:ES</a>)<br />
Data Deposit Box Inc. (<a href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/14" target="_blank">CSE:DDB</a>)<br />
Auxellence Health Corporation (<a href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/16" target="_blank">CSE:AID</a>)<br />
Micromem Technologies Inc. (<a href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/18" target="_blank">CSE:MRM</a>)<br />
Dundee Sustainable Technologies Inc. (<a href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/20" target="_blank">CSE:DST</a>)</p>
<p>To have The CSE Quarterly delivered directly to your inbox, sign-up below:</p>
<div id="mc_embed_signup">
<form id="mc-embedded-subscribe-form" class="validate" action="//thecse.us1.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=b8bfb8508d2636b02d481b0b2&amp;id=68a9f9307e" method="post" name="mc-embedded-subscribe-form" novalidate="" target="_blank">
<div id="mc_embed_signup_scroll"><label for="mce-EMAIL">Subscribe to our mailing list</label><br />
<input id="mce-EMAIL" class="email" name="EMAIL" required="" type="email" value="" placeholder="email address" /><br />
<!-- real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot signups--></p>
<div style="position: absolute; left: -5000px;"><input tabindex="-1" name="b_b8bfb8508d2636b02d481b0b2_68a9f9307e" type="text" value="" /></div>
<div class="clear"><input id="mc-embedded-subscribe" class="button" name="subscribe" type="submit" value="Subscribe" /></div>
</div>
</form>
</div>
<p><!--End mc_embed_signup--><br />
Click below to access the full issue:</p>
<div class="issuuembed" style="width: 474px; height: 307px;" data-configid="0/13174192"></div>
<p><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script src="//e.issuu.com/embed.js" async="true" type="text/javascript"></script></p>
<p>(Trouble accessing the publication below? <a title="The CSE Quarterly - Issue 3" href="http://issuu.com/fusionpublishing/docs/q2_2015_issuu/1" target="_blank">CLICK HERE TO ACCESS THE ISSUE</a>)</p>
<p>Thanks again to our advertisers <a href="http://www.davidson-co.com/" target="_blank">Davidson &amp; Company LLP</a>, and <a href="http://www.bacchuscorplaw.com/" target="_blank">Bacchus Law Corporation</a>.</p>
